---
const {updated='2026-09-21', example=false} = Astro.props;
---
<div class="editorial-note">
  <p><strong>Resumv 发布</strong>· 更新于 <time datetime={updated}>{new Date(updated+'T12:00:00Z').toLocaleDateString('zh-CN',{year:'numeric',month:'long',day:'numeric',timeZone:'UTC'})}</time></p>
  <p>{example?'此示例为借助 AI 编写的虚构教学材料。投递前，请替换姓名、日期、资质和数据。':'本指南借助 AI 起草，提供通用写作建议，未经职业顾问独立审阅。'} <a href="/editorial-policy/">了解编辑政策</a> · <a href="https://github.com/liusha-com/resumv/issues">反馈问题</a></p>
</div>
